---
description: Decide field-level findings for recoverEventPromises.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Reconcile agendas, contracts, accessibility needs, and participant communications to identify commitments that matter. Distinguish published promises from internal preferences and preserve dependencies such as travel, technical setup, and required access arrangements. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
